msgid "Overview"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/remote/esm.md:5 ca55cbaba41f42e1bcd1424c10aa2a44
msgid ""
"The [ESM Cambrian (ESMC)](https://github.com/evolutionaryscale/esm) tool "
"from EvolutionaryScale provides contextualized protein embeddings using "
"protein language models. ESM-C generates 960-dimensional embeddings "
"(mean-pooled across tokens) that capture information about protein "
"structure and function."
msgstr ""

